      ":question/problem": "Two identical boxes contain marbles. The first box contains one blue and one red marble. The second box contains three blue and two red marbles. A box is selected at random, and one marble is chosen from the selected box, also at random. If the selected marble is red, what is the probability that it is from the second box?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
